      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.56785947512957,
        "x1": 0.6541300301599984,
        "y1": 0.5858333313387204
      },
      "text": "Male testicles descend at about 3 ½ months",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.5678431442360472,
        "x1": 0.9770290490352747,
        "y1": 0.5858170004451977
      },
      "text": "your rabbit’s appetite, but know that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.5907352921230341,
        "x1": 0.6561717794399069,
        "y1": 0.6087091483321845
      },
      "text": "of age, and females reach sexual maturity",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.5907189612295114,
        "x1": 0.972306839143387,
        "y1": 0.6086928174386617
      },
      "text": "he or she may not be interested in food",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.6136111091164982,
        "x1": 0.654116158533578,
        "y1": 0.6315849653256485
      },
      "text": "around 4 months of age. Most veterinarians",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.6135947782229754,
        "x1": 0.9770985612965594,
        "y1": 0.6315686344321257
      },
      "text": "the night after surgery. Contact your",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.6364869261099622,
        "x1": 0.6516564879754577,
        "y1": 0.6544607823191125
      },
      "text": "prefer to wait a little longer before performing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.6364705952164394,
        "x1": 0.978904107604364,
        "y1": 0.6544444514255898
      },
      "text": "veterinarian if your rabbit does not",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.6593627431034262,
        "x1": 0.6541994653566919,
        "y1": 0.6773365993125766
      },
      "text": "surgery to minimize the risks for the rabbit.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.6593464122099035,
        "x1": 0.9744735101256707,
        "y1": 0.6773202684190538
      },
      "text": "eat after 24 hours. Check your rabbit’s",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.6822385600968903,
        "x1": 0.6575453016493056,
        "y1": 0.7002124163060406
      },
      "text": "PHS/SPCA has a minimum age limit of 6",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.6822222292033675,
        "x1": 0.9717721650094697,
        "y1": 0.7001960854125179
      },
      "text": "incision twice a day- it should be free of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.7051143770903543,
        "x1": 0.6565050837969539,
        "y1": 0.7230882332995048
      },
      "text": "months for male rabbits and one year for",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.7050980461968316,
        "x1": 0.9731540872593119,
        "y1": 0.723071902405982
      },
      "text": "blood or discharge. Bruising or swelling",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.7279901940838185,
        "x1": 0.45135228320805715,
        "y1": 0.7459640502929688
      },
      "text": "female rabbits.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6906262792722143,
        "y0": 0.7279738631902957,
        "x1": 0.9738874339094066,
        "y1": 0.7459477193994459
      },
      "text": "of the incision/scrotum may occur, but",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
