        "y0": 0.7508496801837596,
        "x1": 0.9740665320194128,
        "y1": 0.76882353639291
      },
      "text": "it is normal. You may notice that your",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.350171715322167,
        "y0": 0.7737418280707465,
        "x1": 0.6554231740007497,
        "y1": 0.7917156842798969
      },
      "text": "I see that your rates are much lower than",
